<title>USA: Christian Cty SDFC, Ky., won by Ross Sinclaire.</title>
<headline>Christian Cty SDFC, Ky., won by Ross Sinclaire.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ross Sinclaire &amp; Assoc., said it won $4.935 million of Christian Cty SDFC, Ky., school building revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.190 percent.</p>
</text>
